  "description": "•Demolition of the existing garage, currently used as storage space.\n\n•Addition of a new one-bedroom flat on top of the existing house, in line with the London Plan, increasing \nresidential capacity. This unit was not included in the initial pre-application advice.\n\n•Construction of a two-storey side extension to serve as an independent dwelling, featuring an open-plan kitchen/living area, two bedrooms, and three bathrooms.\n\n•Demolition of the existing single-storey side extension, currently used as a dining area.\n\n•Construction of a side and rear extension to the existing outrigger, while preserving its original form.\n\n•All new units have been designed in full compliance with the National Described Space Standards and the minimum space requirements set out in London Plan Policy D6.\n",
